    {
      "subId": "7301603",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arabalika",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730160301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730160301": {
            "id": "730160301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "A Nara... and something that flies?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160302"
            ]
          },
          "730160302": {
            "id": "730160302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Yeah, Paimon's Paimon, and Paimon can fly. Oh, and {M#he's}{F#she's} {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160303"
            ]
          },
          "730160303": {
            "id": "730160303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You must be Arabalika. Speaking of which, you don't seem afraid of us at all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160304"
            ]
          },
          "730160304": {
            "id": "730160304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Golden Nara has Arapandu's scent.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160305"
            ]
          },
          "730160305": {
            "id": "730160305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, well, Arapandu did actually ask us to come...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160306"
            ]
          },
          "730160306": {
            "id": "730160306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "No malice. If you wanted to harm Arabalika, you would have attacked when the Big Iron Chunk was still moving.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160307"
            ]
          },
          "730160307": {
            "id": "730160307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh, yeah, that sure would've been what they call \"hitting an Aranara when they're down\"... Wait. Hold on, we wouldn't do anything like that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160308"
            ]
          },
          "730160308": {
            "id": "730160308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Why not? If Arabalika was your enemy, attacking from both sides is a good tactic. Even animals do it when hunting.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160309"
            ]
          },
          "730160309": {
            "id": "730160309",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... You have a point.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160310"
            ]
          },
          "730160310": {
            "id": "730160310",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Getting confused, Paimon?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160311"
            ]
          },
          "730160311": {
            "id": "730160311",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Anyway! We definitely won't \"hit an Aranara when they're down\"!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160312"
            ]
          },
          "730160312": {
            "id": "730160312",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Aranara are our friends, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160313"
            ]
          },
          "730160313": {
            "id": "730160313",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yes, that's right! Aranara are our friends! We won't hurt our friends!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160314"
            ]
          },
          "730160314": {
            "id": "730160314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Hmph.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160315"
            ]
          },
          "730160315": {
            "id": "730160315",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uhh... Why does he seem dissatisfied...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160317",
              "730160319"
            ]
          },
          "730160317": {
            "id": "730160317",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But Paimon doesn't think she did anything wrong... Urgh... Aranara have such strange tempers...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160320"
            ]
          },
          "730160320": {
            "id": "730160320",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh right, Arapandu said that Arabalika's Ararakalari is very powerful. He must have used his Ararakalari to defeat that Ruin Guard earlier!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160321"
            ]
          },
          "730160321": {
            "id": "730160321",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Paimon knows about Ararakalari?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160322"
            ]
          },
          "730160322": {
            "id": "730160322",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Y—Yeah, of course Paimon knows! It's... It's that thing! That really, really powerful... ability!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160323"
            ]
          },
          "730160323": {
            "id": "730160323",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Hmph.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160324"
            ]
          },
          "730160324": {
            "id": "730160324",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Woah! Paimon feels like he's looking down on Paimon again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160325"
            ]
          },
          "730160325": {
            "id": "730160325",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Let's focus on the task at hand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160326"
            ]
          },
          "730160326": {
            "id": "730160326",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah... We're here to help heal the Varuna Contraption! We should be able to find a branch and some leaves here too, right? Why doesn't Paimon see them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160327"
            ]
          },
          "730160327": {
            "id": "730160327",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "What branch? What leaves? They are more like roots.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160328"
            ]
          },
          "730160328": {
            "id": "730160328",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Really? Is that true? But Arapandu said...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160329"
            ]
          },
          "730160329": {
            "id": "730160329",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "The Varuna Contraption gets power from the root system spread throughout Vana.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160330"
            ]
          },
          "730160330": {
            "id": "730160330",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh... That kinda makes sense...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160331"
            ]
          },
          "730160331": {
            "id": "730160331",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "And the roots are underground.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160332"
            ]
          },
          "730160332": {
            "id": "730160332",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "The Stone and Iron Chunks here do not belong to Aranara. To go down, we must defeat Iron Chunks. Iron Chunks are very strong. But Golden Nara is also not weak.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160333"
            ]
          },
          "730160333": {
            "id": "730160333",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Of course! {NICKNAME} has defeated countless Big Iron Chunks already.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160334"
            ]
          },
          "730160334": {
            "id": "730160334",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Oh? Then Arabalika wants to see how strong Nara is!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160335"
            ]
          },
          "730160335": {
            "id": "730160335",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh!? Why did he burrow underground... Oh! Could he have already gone to the Ruin Guard?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730160336"
            ]
          },
          "730160336": {
            "id": "730160336",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, let's follow him!"
          },
          "730160319": {
            "id": "730160319",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How's this possible? How can he look so cute but have such a horrible temper..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
