    {
      "subId": "7301609",
      "subQuestName": "Find the \"branch\" with Arabalika",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7301610",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arabalika",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730161001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730161001": {
            "id": "730161001",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "They seem... they seem broken! They aren't moving at all! Whew. Th—That really gave Paimon a fright back there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161002"
            ]
          },
          "730161002": {
            "id": "730161002",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehehe! So, it's just a bunch of rusty Iron Chunks, eh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161003"
            ]
          },
          "730161003": {
            "id": "730161003",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Careless Paimon. Vana is dangerous now. You will get in trouble.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161004"
            ]
          },
          "730161004": {
            "id": "730161004",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Mm... Arabalika is so strict.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161005"
            ]
          },
          "730161005": {
            "id": "730161005",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You're just too careless, Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161006"
            ]
          },
          "730161006": {
            "id": "730161006",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is that true? Well... If Paimon's as strict as Arabalika, will Paimon be as strong as him?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161007"
            ]
          },
          "730161007": {
            "id": "730161007",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Paimon, you should be stricter on yourself and not to others.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161008"
            ]
          },
          "730161008": {
            "id": "730161008",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Okay, then Paimon'll have strict requirements for herself... starting tomorrow!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161009"
            ]
          },
          "730161009": {
            "id": "730161009",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Anyway, since the stone branch is here, now we need to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161010"
            ]
          },
          "730161010": {
            "id": "730161010",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "We need to make three other rocks face it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161011"
            ]
          },
          "730161011": {
            "id": "730161011",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "H—He took the words out of Paimon's mouth...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161012"
            ]
          },
          "730161012": {
            "id": "730161012",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Speaking of which, Arabalika doesn't talk like the other Aranara. He doesn't use metaphors at all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161014",
              "730161016"
            ]
          },
          "730161014": {
            "id": "730161014",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It really is more direct and easier to understand!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161017"
            ]
          },
          "730161017": {
            "id": "730161017",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Arapandu thinks a lot. Arabalika doesn't think much. Arabalika only knows how to protect.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161018"
            ]
          },
          "730161018": {
            "id": "730161018",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Arapandu once protected Vana with Nara Varuna. They drove away the unknown black mud. Healed the Varuna Contraption.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161019"
            ]
          },
          "730161019": {
            "id": "730161019",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "#It has been a long time since Nara Varuna left Vana. Maybe {F#he}{M#she} won't come to Festival Utsava anymore.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161020"
            ]
          },
          "730161020": {
            "id": "730161020",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Arapandu must know. It has been so many years since then. Enough time for a small seed to grow into a towering tree. Nara who leave Vana will never return.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161021"
            ]
          },
          "730161021": {
            "id": "730161021",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "But Arapandu wants to heal the Varuna Contraption again. For Vana. For Festival Utsava. For Nara Varuna.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161022"
            ]
          },
          "730161022": {
            "id": "730161022",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon gets it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161023"
            ]
          },
          "730161023": {
            "id": "730161023",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "#Arabalika never met Nara Varuna, but {F#his}{M#her} story is remembered by Vana.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161024"
            ]
          },
          "730161024": {
            "id": "730161024",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Arabalika doesn't think as much as Arapandu. Arabalika only knows that he must become strong to protect Aranara and Vana.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161025"
            ]
          },
          "730161025": {
            "id": "730161025",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Nara Varuna is no longer here, but Aranara can still heal the Varuna Contraption.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161026"
            ]
          },
          "730161026": {
            "id": "730161026",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yup! We'll help out too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161027"
            ]
          },
          "730161027": {
            "id": "730161027",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "#Something is wrong with the smell of iron. Nara {NICKNAME}, Arabalika will leave this to you. Will wait here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161028"
            ]
          },
          "730161028": {
            "id": "730161028",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon doesn't know what you sensed, Arabalika... But oh well. Paimon's sure you know more about the forest than us!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161029"
            ]
          },
          "730161029": {
            "id": "730161029",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Anyway, {NICKNAME}, let's start looking around here for the three scattered leaves."
          },
          "730161016": {
            "id": "730161016",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, what would be \"more like an Aranara\" anyway? Oh well, Paimon doesn't get it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7301613",
      "subQuestName": "Make the three \"leaves\" turn towards the \"branch\"",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730161301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730161301": {
            "id": "730161301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Smells of too much iron. Not good."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7301611",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat the Ruin Graders",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7301615",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arabalika",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730161501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730161501": {
            "id": "730161501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Phew... That was scary! It's a good thing that Arabalika helped out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161502"
            ]
          },
          "730161502": {
            "id": "730161502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Arabalika told you so. Paimon is careless. Will get in trouble.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161503"
            ]
          },
          "730161503": {
            "id": "730161503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Alright, alright... Paimon's got it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161504"
            ]
          },
          "730161504": {
            "id": "730161504",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Ruin Guards are here to do their job too, you know.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161505"
            ]
          },
          "730161505": {
            "id": "730161505",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, guards should be guarding something against trespassers. After all, we're outsiders to them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161506"
            ]
          },
          "730161506": {
            "id": "730161506",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "#Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon are outsiders to Vana. Not Arabalika. The Huge Iron Chunk is making no sense.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161507"
            ]
          },
          "730161507": {
            "id": "730161507",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Arabalika will teach it sense.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161508"
            ]
          },
          "730161508": {
            "id": "730161508",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Woah... Um, Paimon will become more sensible in the future!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161509"
            ]
          },
          "730161509": {
            "id": "730161509",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll hold you to your word, Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161510"
            ]
          },
          "730161510": {
            "id": "730161510",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Of course! Tomorrow... No, starting from now!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161511"
            ]
          },
          "730161511": {
            "id": "730161511",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "#Only Aranara can awaken the stone here. Leave the rest to Arabalika, Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161512"
            ]
          },
          "730161512": {
            "id": "730161512",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooooh!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161513"
            ]
          },
          "730161513": {
            "id": "730161513",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We're one step closer to healing the Varuna Contraption! Once it is healed, there won't be so many spores in Apam Woods anymore... Just thinking about it makes Paimon's nose itch...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161514"
            ]
          },
          "730161514": {
            "id": "730161514",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "The Varuna Contraption will purify rainwater. There will not be black rain or so many spores.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161515"
            ]
          },
          "730161515": {
            "id": "730161515",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "But there should still be mushrooms. Be careful, Paimon. You might get eaten by them. Like Aranakula.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161516"
            ]
          },
          "730161516": {
            "id": "730161516",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yes... Paimon'll be careful!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161517"
            ]
          },
          "730161517": {
            "id": "730161517",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "#Arabalika no longer needed here. Arabalika will return to the \"rest stop\" to look for Arapandu. Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon, will you return with Arabalika?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730161519",
              "730161521"
            ]
          },
          "730161519": {
            "id": "730161519",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Yes. It is dangerous in Vana. Traveling together is safer."
          },
          "730161521": {
            "id": "730161521",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "#Be careful, Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon. Don't be careless. May Aramuhukunda watch over you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
